    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d228">

                <pb facs="0315" n="235" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg235"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-12-20"><hi rendition="#italic">December 20,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to my dispatch No. 721, I have received letter from Lilly-white’s
                    counsel, inclosing one from him accepting the sum offered. Shall I inform
                    foreign office that we accept the proposed settlement of the claim, ask for the
                    amount, and hand it over to Lillywhite, who seems anxious for money?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
